{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-133",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "One circular disk, horizontal and vertical diameters divide four equal quadrants. Both lower quadrants shaded, both upper quadrants unshaded. No points, labels, fraction text or exterior objects. Exact regular circle/orthogonal equal quadrants replace scan distortion, flat semantic fill replaces hatching; bottom half stays shaded.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-133.png",
      "sha256": "dddee8aad319092bfbd6d6b9b01185fb879ae92c470d19bf53fb58889daae9b2"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "如图133所示，把圆分成四等份，其中两部分涂有阴影.两部分，即圆的$\\frac{2}{4}$. 因为阴影部分是圆的一半，所以圆的$\\frac{2}{4}$等于圆的$\\frac{1}{2}$. 因而分数$\\frac{2}{4}$和$\\frac{1}{2}$相等.$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "如果把圆的每四分之一再分成三等份（图134），整个圆就被分成12等份，有阴影部分是其中的6等份，就是，$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{6}{12}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "$\\frac{2}{4}$的分子和分母同乘以3，可得$\\frac{6}{12}$：\n$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{2\\cdot3}{4\\cdot3}=\\frac{6}{12}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "一般地说，如果分数的分子和分母同乘或同除以相同的自然数，就可以得到与原分数相等的分数."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "这种性质叫做分数的基本性质. 例如：\n$\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{4}{10}$；\n$\\frac{9}{15}=\\frac{3}{5}$；\n$\\frac{16}{8}=\\frac{2}{1}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "两个相等的分数是同一个数的不同写法."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "可以写成分数形式的数叫做有理数. 有理数的集合用$Q$表示. 任何整数都是有理数，例如：\n$4=\\frac{4}{1},\\quad-6=\\frac{-6}{1},\\quad0=\\frac{0}{1}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "text": "整数集合$Z$是有理数集合$Q$的子集，即，$Z\\subset Q$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "694",
        "text": "694. 将$\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{25}{8},\\frac{39}{40}$各分数的分子和分母同乘以5，并写出等式."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "695",
        "text": "695. 把$\\frac{6}{3},\\ \\frac{9}{6},\\ \\frac{15}{9},\\ \\frac{33}{21}$各分数的分子和分母同除以3，并写出等式."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "696",
        "text": "696. 说明下列等式为什么能成立：\n1) $\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{8}{10}$；\n2) $\\frac{44}{100}=\\frac{11}{25}$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "697",
        "text": "697. 求出正有理数集合和负有理数集合的交集与并集."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "698",
        "text": "698. 求出整数集合和有理数集合的交集与并集."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "699",
        "text": "699. 解方程：$3x+96=1568-5x$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "700",
        "text": "700. 鸡兔同笼. 共有19个头，62只脚（图135）. 笼中有鸡、兔各几只？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "701",
        "text": "701. 求出下式的值：$(36\\cdot1.5+3.6\\cdot85):1.8+11.88:0.11$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "702",
        "text": "702. 将$\\frac{18}{27},\\frac{27}{36},\\frac{72}{63},\\frac{45}{27}$各分数的分子和分母同除以9，并写出等式."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "703",
        "text": "703. 回答：\n1) 在$\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{3},\\frac{3}{2}$中有几个$\\frac{1}{6}$？\n2) 在$\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{2}{3},\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{4}{3}$中有几个$\\frac{1}{15}$？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s1-n38",
        "exercise": "704",
        "text": "704. 某仓库第二天发出的钢丝是第一天的2倍，第三天是第一天的3倍，如果第一天发出的钢丝比第三天少30公斤，那么三天共发出多少公斤钢丝？"
      }
    ],
